    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1208-a1">

                <pb facs="0881" n="805" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg805"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">declaration</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The undersigned, duly authorized by their Governments, make the following joint
                    declaration:</p>
                <p>Taking into consideration the guaranties of juridical equality offered to aliens
                    by the French tribunals of the protectorate, the Government of the United States
                    of America relinquishes its claim to all the rights and privileges growing out
                    of the capitulation régime for its consuls, the persons subject to its
                    jurisdiction and its establishments within the French zone of the Shereefian
                    Empire.</p>
                <p>The treaties and conventions of every description in force between France and the
                    United States extend as of right, unless otherwise specifically provided, to the
                    French zone of the Shereefian Empire.</p>
                <p>The present declaration will go into effect within __ days from the date of
                    signature.</p>
                <p>Done in duplicate, at Washington, this ___</p>
            </div>
        </body>
